OL,3,GNEWSATeen's poetry bridging gap between
OL,4,Acultures                               
OL,6,FThe 15-year-old was one of the Foyles  
OL,7,FYoung Poets of the Year and wrote her  
OL,8,Fwinning entry, Miss the Boat, about the
OL,9,Fgap between the two cultures.          
